{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QoJGzWMwYTRqKvK6iGR1Mj","type":"tool_result","content":"example :: Usage: taskspec example task-plan --out <file> [--force] :: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\nstatus :: Usage: taskspec status <task-id-or-path> [--json] | taskspec status --initiative <id> :: none; emits TaskStatus/v1 and exactly one safe next command\ndecompose :: Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options] :: Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation.\ndecompose init :: Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|-> :: Create explicit intent workspace.\ndecompose prepare :: Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace] :: Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it.\ndecompose review :: Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text> :: Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology.\ndecompose compile :: Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative> :: Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves.\ndecompose status :: Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative> :: none\ndecompose impact :: Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json> :: none\ndecompose import :: Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace> :: Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required.\nsetup decompose :: Usage: taskspec setup decompose  :: Provision locked dependencies in the private runtime.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc1bdb76-9aec-439c-aab4-d239c156bb31","uuid":"e0f02e20-de6c-496f-8bdc-afedc3e2197a","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:42:33.977Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"example :: Usage: taskspec example task-plan --out <file> [--force] :: writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing\nstatus :: Usage: taskspec status <task-id-or-path> [--json] | taskspec status --initiative <id> :: none; emits TaskStatus/v1 and exactly one safe next command\ndecompose :: Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options] :: Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation.\ndecompose init :: Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|-> :: Create explicit intent workspace.\ndecompose prepare :: Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace] :: Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it.\ndecompose review :: Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text> :: Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology.\ndecompose compile :: Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative> :: Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves.\ndecompose status :: Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative> :: none\ndecompose impact :: Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json> :: none\ndecompose import :: Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace> :: Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required.\nsetup decompose :: Usage: taskspec setup decompose  :: Provision locked dependencies in the private runtime.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
